                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1156e4a5-9aed-4cd2-bef6-10bddb7ef58c",
                                                "sense_id": "955ef388-1e63-35cd-9a50-5e028d9366a1",
                                                "text": "I poked about in the rubble, trying to find my lost keys."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3c2292b-e9e0-3180-8f9e-b705cac1a176",
                                        "entry_id": "90d99af9-3999-32cc-8aef-c78f806ce732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To modify the value stored in (a memory address)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6901999-a864-4226-9154-31960d2d0531",
                                                "sense_id": "b3c2292b-e9e0-3180-8f9e-b705cac1a176",
                                                "text": "The 200 UDGs may be used either by paging between 10 sets of 20 UDGs or, alternatively, by displaying 96 different characters by poking the system variable CHARS with 256 less than the starting address of your graphics."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c68fd882-e937-42f2-b840-8899b301d6c5",
                                                "sense_id": "b3c2292b-e9e0-3180-8f9e-b705cac1a176",
                                                "text": "If you try to poke a value outside this range into a byte, Basic will beep you with an ILLEGAL QUANTITY error."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf0a34f1-d73d-369b-bf4c-680decf0e1e0",
                                        "entry_id": "90d99af9-3999-32cc-8aef-c78f806ce732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To put a poke (device to prevent leaping or breaking fences) on (an animal)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "906ca67d-3794-4968-8f4f-50a7431860f6",
                                                "sense_id": "cf0a34f1-d73d-369b-bf4c-680decf0e1e0",
                                                "text": "to poke an ox"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fcaea8c-b655-496a-85c8-a9721e46df91",
                                                "sense_id": "cf0a34f1-d73d-369b-bf4c-680decf0e1e0",
                                                "text": "I find from their testimony , which was not contradicted , that the placing of such a poke upon such a colt in such a pasture is not considered dangerous, and that farmers are accustomed so to poke their own horses, but that they are not accustomed to put pokes on or 'hamper' horses owned by other persons without the authorization of the owner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fb2bc2a-599c-3c47-a2ee-acd98991dc86",
                                        "entry_id": "90d99af9-3999-32cc-8aef-c78f806ce732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To thrust at with the horns; to gore."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "77feb726-63e1-3d99-bd50-a33be0918760",
                                        "entry_id": "90d99af9-3999-32cc-8aef-c78f806ce732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To notify (another user) of activity on social media or an instant messenger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8437c15-bf4a-4094-bfd0-fdeea7094a7a",
                                                "sense_id": "77feb726-63e1-3d99-bd50-a33be0918760",
                                                "text": "Indeed, when we poke users who normally do not have access to our profiles, they will be able to temporarily see our Basic Info, Work Info, and Education Info."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55fbb71d-2891-35aa-9cc8-ce71867365e6",
                                        "entry_id": "90d99af9-3999-32cc-8aef-c78f806ce732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To thrust (something) in a particular direction such as the tongue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ab01f8f-adc5-3de6-a7c3-436f6fbb0a02",
                                        "entry_id": "90d99af9-3999-32cc-8aef-c78f806ce732",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To penetrate in sexual intercourse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "transitive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f45fdf7f-90bf-4ece-869d-e8cb13c6cb67",
                                                "sense_id": "2ab01f8f-adc5-3de6-a7c3-436f6fbb0a02",
                                                "text": "Maj. Cloutier commented to Lt. Clemm, \"You know what they say about a girl who smokes: If she smokes, she pokes.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0db9d18a-a45c-45bb-bcf6-8f804f6402d4",
                                                "sense_id": "2ab01f8f-adc5-3de6-a7c3-436f6fbb0a02",
                                                "text": "He chewed her nipples and clitoris until they bled, and poked her until she could hardly walk. Grandpa never got enough sex […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5851a159-2e3b-40ac-8b60-0886eac8b36f",
                                                "sense_id": "2ab01f8f-adc5-3de6-a7c3-436f6fbb0a02",
                                                "text": "No big deal. I poked Ana a bunch of times.",
                                                "translation": "And Your Mother Too",
                                                "english": "And Your Mother Too"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "poke",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74ccff2b-e281-338a-a01f-bcaa94ee6026",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A prod, jab, or thrust."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c10fb26-c62b-3bb6-ad3c-93ecb514bc8f",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A lazy person; a dawdler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e64a2e2a-ab63-4440-a6b6-4ab8afd7111a",
                                                "sense_id": "2c10fb26-c62b-3bb6-ad3c-93ecb514bc8f",
                                                "text": "The slowness of this stupid poke tortures me to death."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3daae7-4f3a-45e1-9f56-a0ef60ad5814",
                                                "sense_id": "2c10fb26-c62b-3bb6-ad3c-93ecb514bc8f",
                                                "text": "To the uninitiated he looked like a slow old poke; but his string would lengthen out in a most mysterious way , and it was the height of our ambition to set as much and as clean a proof as old John."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fd70933-9e31-4bd7-9675-8b9580bb57f3",
                                                "sense_id": "2c10fb26-c62b-3bb6-ad3c-93ecb514bc8f",
                                                "text": "I never saw such an old poke. You come up here and expect me to do some things for you, and then you stand around as though you were made of bone!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9314eaa5-e2fd-49f6-b8f5-08941e3c3b9f",
                                                "sense_id": "2c10fb26-c62b-3bb6-ad3c-93ecb514bc8f",
                                                "text": "The three laugh at him for a slow old poke and go on to their pleasure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d647a5f2-f7ae-4eff-8fd2-43aab6104ed9",
                                                "sense_id": "2c10fb26-c62b-3bb6-ad3c-93ecb514bc8f",
                                                "text": "Old Fred is the slowest old poke, isn't he? Suppose I try, Paul."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c926136f-d638-36f8-a5c5-71fa0de28e77",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A stupid or uninteresting person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d57127c8-a69e-45e5-aa84-66d64dbb3aa9",
                                                "sense_id": "c926136f-d638-36f8-a5c5-71fa0de28e77",
                                                "text": "I see you shaking your head at me, mother, and reminding me of 'That mercy I to others show, that mercy show to me;' but I don't believe I go on so; if I have nothing to say I keep still, and you'd better be a stupid poke, which I often feel myself, than waste the time with such trash."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfa90327-386e-4017-9086-f9e2b03a2e69",
                                                "sense_id": "c926136f-d638-36f8-a5c5-71fa0de28e77",
                                                "text": "She was only sixteen, and he was perfectly splendid, and she has plenty of money, and every one talked about it; and when she went anywhere, people looked, you know, and she liked it; but her papa is an old poke, so he's sent them all away. It's too bad, for she was the jolliest thing I ever knew ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f2a67eb-82eb-4ad4-8646-e3098a8d8837",
                                                "sense_id": "c926136f-d638-36f8-a5c5-71fa0de28e77",
                                                "text": "I think you are all reasonably well aware that the common picture of the surveying and mapping profession is proabably best exemplified at the present time by the old poke who is out with a rickety old transit, wearing old ragged clothes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1204ddd6-7dd1-43db-9453-ea5f84cefa96",
                                                "sense_id": "c926136f-d638-36f8-a5c5-71fa0de28e77",
                                                "text": "\"Oh, you old poke, you! You think nobody can be grown up but yourself. I really believe they all think I'm a great deal older than I am, and I just hope you won't go and tell them I am not. \"Now, will you?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "069d8308-5bbc-4b15-840b-1af5f4ec9534",
                                                "sense_id": "c926136f-d638-36f8-a5c5-71fa0de28e77",
                                                "text": "“That's what you're going to rob?” she asked Cole. “Yep.” He viewed the scene with a hand shading his eyes, then grinned at Billy. “Only a driver and one old poke riding shotgun. You'd think they'd have learned better by now.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d97b4c55-9128-307a-a561-e247c4821479",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An old, worn-out horse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70baa9f0-270d-4d12-b495-e4ef37f73e5c",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b4c55-9128-307a-a561-e247c4821479",
                                                "text": "It was feared the dear old poke I had been riding could not keep up with the rest on this long day's journey: so I had \"the cook's horse,\" who did not understand my method of pulling my dear old beast's head from the edge of the ravine gently with my bridle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae2b47d1-043f-4c99-9cce-b7d4d84bf37d",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b4c55-9128-307a-a561-e247c4821479",
                                                "text": "Probably summer residents, and this old poke won't move out of a walk, and I've no whip."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8122a30b-c914-4aea-a929-ee39b2b4391d",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b4c55-9128-307a-a561-e247c4821479",
                                                "text": "Yes, mother, but my horse is such an old poke I was nowhere in the race."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15993e9d-ada0-4439-8507-e2abcb3b75bb",
                                                "sense_id": "d97b4c55-9128-307a-a561-e247c4821479",
                                                "text": "It's not the helo's fault, even if it is clunkier than a stumblebum old poke of a plow horse—bless its rotors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd86ec10-1a49-34db-aef9-7d46193da12f",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A device to prevent an animal from leaping or breaking through fences, consisting of a yoke with a pole inserted, pointed forward."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee5ad799-8283-4ead-8b1d-a12801e04e18",
                                                "sense_id": "fd86ec10-1a49-34db-aef9-7d46193da12f",
                                                "text": "I find from their testimony , which was not contradicted , that the placing of such a poke upon such a colt in such a pasture is not considered dangerous, and that farmers are accustomed so to poke their own horses, but that they are not accustomed to put pokes on or 'hamper' horses owned by other persons without the authorization of the owner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98662ed9-4093-4083-9c0e-959bacc8b5f5",
                                                "sense_id": "fd86ec10-1a49-34db-aef9-7d46193da12f",
                                                "text": "This yoke or poke will prevent any horse from scaling a fence, if well made."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d527c0b2-b7d5-3fbe-b108-68ab6d19a308",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The storage of a value in a memory address, typically to modify the behaviour of a program or to cheat at a video game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98cbdfd6-c92c-45f0-91b2-f9badcb6457b",
                                                "sense_id": "d527c0b2-b7d5-3fbe-b108-68ab6d19a308",
                                                "text": "One of the major limitations is that the Commodore 64 does not easily support auto-repeat (it must be turned on by a poke instruction from BASIC)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a114279c-97ef-4082-8e84-fd6ba79e927b",
                                                "sense_id": "d527c0b2-b7d5-3fbe-b108-68ab6d19a308",
                                                "text": "[…] everywhere you see listings festooned with Goto statements and peppered with peeks and pokes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ed90578-e7ef-42cb-a072-9ae2a565cf9c",
                                                "sense_id": "d527c0b2-b7d5-3fbe-b108-68ab6d19a308",
                                                "text": "Perhaps all those super hackers who so regularly produce infinite lives etc. could produce pokes to be used by 128K users."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66616c43-7cde-37ff-889c-517226b2b834",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A notification sent to get another user's attention on social media or an instant messenger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af373079-9b19-49d9-b171-d756669a58ad",
                                                "sense_id": "66616c43-7cde-37ff-889c-517226b2b834",
                                                "text": "It could be described as a poke, but not a friendly one. For those who have not yet succumbed to Facebook, the latest craze on the internet, a ‘poke’ is an electronic greeting sent, for example, to an old friend from university."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f603c5c9-90ab-3146-b482-45478bdc8bf9",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A poke bonnet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6024a4f9-bad6-4dc7-aa8e-0e36ae324849",
                                                "sense_id": "f603c5c9-90ab-3146-b482-45478bdc8bf9",
                                                "text": "Well then, I declare, I'd rather see Miss Lawton in that old poke – old as it is! –than in the finest new bonnet the Squire's lady ever wore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1830ceaa-8a0d-3166-a32b-b246f05eab0d",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d8535-e8a7-3cfc-907e-3a3441e4ec0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hit, especially an extra base hit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "poke",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6701aa71-c6cb-38a0-80be-63b6983a65a8",
                                        "entry_id": "619d1020-ef8b-3eea-a1d9-af936ce904ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sack or bag."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Appalachia",
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3608991d-9ff6-49c4-9416-828471d48337",
                                                "sense_id": "6701aa71-c6cb-38a0-80be-63b6983a65a8",
                                                "text": "And then he drew a dial from his poke,\nAnd, looking on it with lack-lustre eye,\nSays very wisely, ‘It is ten o'clock[…]’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3edad473-b2e0-47ac-9231-b932188d9a91",
                                                "sense_id": "6701aa71-c6cb-38a0-80be-63b6983a65a8",
                                                "text": "When the Pig is proffered, hold vp the poke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "743bc825-a04a-42d1-b08b-2427681bdc7c",
                                                "sense_id": "6701aa71-c6cb-38a0-80be-63b6983a65a8",
                                                "text": "And suddainly vntyes the Poke,\nWhich out of it sent such a smoke,\nAs ready was them all to choke,\nSo greeuous was the pother […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da3deb10-620a-4bd2-b392-0301bfa3ffde",
                                                "sense_id": "6701aa71-c6cb-38a0-80be-63b6983a65a8",
                                                "text": "… and as to shape, a nightmare has as much. Under the poke and the muff-box, the face sometimes entirely disappears …"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3d29c24-8dfb-4069-9463-2ad94caf7d24",
                                                "sense_id": "6701aa71-c6cb-38a0-80be-63b6983a65a8",
                                                "text": "In the summertime they'd reach out and snatch your straw hat right off your head, and if you were fool enough to go after it your poke was bound to be lighter when you came out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de041013-a628-4934-aeec-06f57db51dcd",
                                                "sense_id": "6701aa71-c6cb-38a0-80be-63b6983a65a8",
                                                "text": "She did not eat blood-oranges. Her maw gived her one in a poke and she was going to throw it in the bin, Oh it is all black."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "781f7b35-7f39-340f-abc0-7b1e8522fdd0",
                                        "entry_id": "619d1020-ef8b-3eea-a1d9-af936ce904ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A long, wide sleeve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8df0e16-cdac-3970-9dd2-e56eee599ac9",
                                        "entry_id": "619d1020-ef8b-3eea-a1d9-af936ce904ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ice cream cone or a bag of chips"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Northern-Ireland",
                                            "Scotland"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "poke",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19d0f7bb-51e2-3436-b55a-76fa225c3c24",
                                        "entry_id": "8c25d24a-178e-3bbe-848d-9ca11d4b367f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pokeweed, and its berries."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dialectal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebb88578-3807-4381-a43d-469cbcf6b545",
                                                "sense_id": "19d0f7bb-51e2-3436-b55a-76fa225c3c24",
                                                "text": "[W]hen rodents were scarce they ate chestnuts and rhubarb and poke and other wild food[.]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "poke",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57b55c7a-9c44-36ff-80b5-50b33d924b14",
                                        "entry_id": "c418aba8-e4ce-3de8-85df-bb18e2c955ee",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Slices or cubes of raw fish or other raw seafood, mixed with sesame oil, seaweed, sea salt, herbs, spices, or other flavorful ingredients."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Hawaii",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37d64ccb-e78a-4b0d-a378-e8b2fa5b0528",
                                                "sense_id": "57b55c7a-9c44-36ff-80b5-50b33d924b14",
                                                "text": "Though I'd often eaten sashimi, poke was then completely new to me—delicious rubies of cubed fish dressed in light sesame oil, garnished with minced bits of reddish-brown seaweed and the ground centers of kukui nuts (see recipe, next page)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d291347c-eef3-4403-bae8-1992c923956c",
                                                "sense_id": "57b55c7a-9c44-36ff-80b5-50b33d924b14",
                                                "text": "The fishmonger offered the poke in plastic tubs, without ceremony, just as I had always known it in Honolulu, where I grew up and where some of the best poke is sold at a liquor store, Tamura’s. Then, a few years back, poke started appearing on stray restaurant menus, sometimes identified as Hawaiian crudo or ceviche."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
